OL,3,ARAF pauses fighter jet training after
OL,4,Atwo pilots eject from plane before
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FHigh-speed Hawk fighter jet training
OL,8,Fhas been "temporarily" paused as a
OL,9,F"precautionary measure", the RAF has
OL,10,Fsaid, after two of its pilots ejected
OL,11,Fand parachuted out of their plane
OL,12,Fmoments before it crashed, narrowly
OL,13,Fmissing homes.
OL,15,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft had been flying
OL,16,Fout of the RAF Valley base on Anglesey
OL,17,Fwhen it plummeted to the ground at
OL,18,Fnearby Pencarnisiog.
OL,20,FNorth Wales Police said the pilots, who
OL,21,Fhad been flying a training aircraft,
OL,22,Fwere being treated for minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
